ages/api/src/routers/avatar.integration.test.ts:112\n   - **Recommendation**: Add with separate test DB URL\n\n### Medium Priority (Development/Testing)\n\n4. **`EXPO_PUBLIC_KEYCHAIN_SERVICE`**\n   - **Impact**: Uses hardcoded fallback\n   - **Referenced In**: apps/mobile/app/(auth)/password-reset.tsx:11\n   - **Recommendation**: Add for consistency (low risk as fallback exists)\n\n5. **`SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL`**\n   - **Impact**: Consent audit notifications not sent to Slack\n   - **Referenced In**: scripts/consent-compliance-audit.ts:81\n   - **Recommendation**: Add if Slack integration needed\n\n6. **`SKIP_APPLE_VERIFICATION_CHECK`**\n   - **Impact**: None (feature flag for disabling checks)\n   - **Referenced In**: packages/api/src/routers/credits.ts:418\n   - **Recommendation**: Document but don't add to `.env.example` (dev-only flag)\n\n7. **`SKIP_GOOGLE_VERIFICATION_CHECK`**\n   - **Impact**: None (feature flag for disabling checks)\n   - **Referenced In**: packages/api/src/routers/credits.ts:538\n   - **Recommendation**: Document but don't add to `.env.example` (dev-only flag)\n\n8. **`COPPA_CONSENT_WEBHOOK_URL` / `CONSENT_EVENTS_WEBHOOK_URL`**\n   - **Impact**: External consent event tracking disabled\n   - **Referenced In**: packages/api/src/env.ts:17-18\n   - **Recommendation**: Add if external consent system required\n\n9. **`PHOTO_DELETION_TTL_HOURS`**\n   - **Impact**: None (uses default 36 hours)\n   - **Referenced In**: packages/api/src/env.ts:24\n   - **Note**: `.env.example` has `TEMP_UPLOADS_TTL_HOURS` (48), code checks `PHOTO_DELETION_TTL_HOURS`\n   - **Recommendation**: Align variable names or add alias\n\n10. **`GIT_SHA` / `API_VERSION`**\n    - **Impact**: Release tracking less accurate\n    - **Referenced In**: packages/api/src/env.ts:20-21\n    - **Recommendation**: Set in CI/CD, not local `.env`\n\n### Low Priority (Auto-Injected or CI-Only)\n\n11. **`VERCEL`** (auto-injected by Vercel)\n12. **`VERCEL_ENV`** (auto-injected by Vercel)\n13. **`VER